__pycache__/
*.pyc
core/visitors.json
# Terminal-stage (provisional, ungraduated) skills — local only, not published.
# Graduate via the FH 6-item creation gate before tracking.
# NOTE: `.claude/*` (glob), NOT `.claude/` (directory pattern) — git cannot re-include anything
# inside a directory excluded via the recursive form (verified: `git check-ignore` still matched
# `.claude/capabilities/x` against a plain `!.claude/capabilities/` negation under the old rule).
# The glob form still excludes every top-level entry individually, so this closes exactly as
# tightly, but leaves the negation below actually reachable.
.claude/*
# Exception: a node identity/capability declaration is NOT a terminal skill — it is a
# machine-readable claim about what this repo IS and WILL NOT do (FH capability_composition_contract.md
# §ⓒ), not a provisional prose skill the 6-item gate is meant to hold back. Track it.
!.claude/capabilities/

# 위성 — 로컬 전용(운영자 리터럴·웹권한). 공개 표면에 안 올린다
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/rules/.public-surface-patterns
.claude/rules/.public-surface-patterns.defaults
signals/logs/
